{"s":72,"v":[{"t":"Say, [O Muḥammad], \"It has been revealed to me that a group of the jinn listened and said, 'Indeed, we have heard an amazing Qur’ān [i.e., recitation].","w":[["قُلْ","Say","qul",""],["أُوحِىَ","It has been revealed","ūḥiya",""],["إِلَىَّ","to me","ilayya","",[["إِلَىَّ",26],["",20]]],["أَنَّهُ","that","annahu","",[["أَنَّ",41],["هُ",5]]],["ٱسْتَمَعَ","listened","is'tamaʿa",""],["نَفَرٌۭ","a group","nafarun",""],["مِّنَ","of","mina",""],["ٱلْجِنِّ","the jinn","l-jini","",[["ٱلْ",2],["جِنِّ",469]]],["فَقَالُوٓا۟","and they said","faqālū","",[["فَ",7],["قَالُ",16],["وٓا۟",3]]],["إِنَّا","Indeed, we","innā","",[["إِنَّ",15],["ا",11]]],["سَمِعْنَا","heard","samiʿ'nā","",[["سَمِعْ",160],["نَا",11]]],["قُرْءَانًا","a Quran","qur'ānan",""],["عَجَبًۭا","amazing","ʿajaban",""]]},{"t":"It guides to the right course, and we have believed in it. And we will never associate with our Lord anyone.","w":[["يَهْدِىٓ","It guides","yahdī",""],["إِلَى","to","ilā",""],["ٱلرُّشْدِ","the right way","l-rush'di","",[["ٱل",2],["رُّشْدِ",1169]]],["فَـَٔامَنَّا","so we believe","faāmannā","",[["فَ",7],["ـَٔامَ",30],["نَّا",11]]],["بِهِۦ","in it","bihi","ۖ",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["وَلَن","and never","walan","",[["وَ",1],["لَن",126]]],["نُّشْرِكَ","we will associate","nush'rika",""],["بِرَبِّنَآ","with our Lord","birabbinā","",[["بِ",10],["رَبِّ",24],["نَآ",11]]],["أَحَدًۭا","anyone","aḥadan",""]]},{"t":"And [it teaches] that exalted is the nobleness of our Lord; He has not taken a wife or a son","w":[["وَأَنَّهُۥ","And that He ","wa-annahu","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["هُۥ",5]]],["تَعَـٰلَىٰ","Exalted is","taʿālā",""],["جَدُّ","(the) Majesty","jaddu",""],["رَبِّنَا","(of) our Lord ","rabbinā","",[["رَبِّ",24],["نَا",11]]],["مَا","not","mā",""],["ٱتَّخَذَ","He has taken","ittakhadha",""],["صَـٰحِبَةًۭ","a wife","ṣāḥibatan",""],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["وَلَدًۭا","a son","waladan",""]]},{"t":"And that our foolish one [i.e., Iblees] has been saying about Allāh an excessive transgression.","w":[["وَأَنَّهُۥ","And that he","wa-annahu","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["هُۥ",5]]],["كَانَ","used to","kāna",""],["يَقُولُ","speak ","yaqūlu",""],["سَفِيهُنَا","the foolish among us","safīhunā","",[["سَفِيهُ",1074],["نَا",11]]],["عَلَى","against","ʿalā",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["شَطَطًۭا","an excessive transgression","shaṭaṭan",""]]},{"t":"And we had thought that mankind and the jinn would never speak about Allāh a lie.","w":[["وَأَنَّا","And that we","wa-annā","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["ا",11]]],["ظَنَنَّآ","thought","ẓanannā","",[["ظَنَ",261],["نَّآ",11]]],["أَن","that","an",""],["لَّن","never","lan",""],["تَقُولَ","will say","taqūla",""],["ٱلْإِنسُ","the men","l-insu","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسُ",539]]],["وَٱلْجِنُّ","and the jinn","wal-jinu","",[["وَ",1],["ٱلْ",2],["جِنُّ",469]]],["عَلَى","against","ʿalā",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["كَذِبًۭا","any lie","kadhiban",""]]},{"t":"And there were men from mankind who sought refuge in men from the jinn, so they [only] increased them in burden [i.e., sin].","w":[["وَأَنَّهُۥ","And that","wa-annahu","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["هُۥ",5]]],["كَانَ","(there) were","kāna",""],["رِجَالٌۭ","men","rijālun",""],["مِّنَ","among","mina",""],["ٱلْإِنسِ","mankind","l-insi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["إِنسِ",539]]],["يَعُوذُونَ","who sought refuge","yaʿūdhūna","",[["يَعُوذُ",841],["ونَ",3]]],["بِرِجَالٍۢ","in (the) men","birijālin","",[["بِ",10],["رِجَالٍۢ",215]]],["مِّنَ","from","mina",""],["ٱلْجِنِّ","the jinn","l-jini","",[["ٱلْ",2],["جِنِّ",469]]],["فَزَادُوهُمْ","so they increased them","fazādūhum","",[["فَ",7],["زَادُ",249],["و",3],["هُمْ",3]]],["رَهَقًۭا","(in) burden","rahaqan",""]]},{"t":"And they had thought, as you thought, that Allāh would never send anyone [as a messenger].","w":[["وَأَنَّهُمْ","And that they","wa-annahum","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["هُمْ",3]]],["ظَنُّوا۟","thought","ẓannū","",[["ظَنُّ",261],["وا۟",3]]],["كَمَا","as","kamā","",[["كَ",54],["مَا",12]]],["ظَنَنتُمْ","you thought","ẓanantum","",[["ظَنَن",261],["تُمْ",4]]],["أَن","that","an",""],["لَّن","never","lan",""],["يَبْعَثَ","will raise","yabʿatha",""],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah","l-lahu",""],["أَحَدًۭا","anyone","aḥadan",""]]},{"t":"And we have sought [to reach] the heaven but found it filled with powerful guards and burning flames.","w":[["وَأَنَّا","And that we","wa-annā","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["ا",11]]],["لَمَسْنَا","sought to touch","lamasnā","",[["لَمَسْ",1616],["نَا",11]]],["ٱلسَّمَآءَ","the heaven","l-samāa","",[["ٱل",2],["سَّمَآءَ",49]]],["فَوَجَدْنَـٰهَا","but we found it","fawajadnāhā","",[["فَ",7],["وَجَدْ",127],["نَ",11],["ـٰهَا",22]]],["مُلِئَتْ","filled (with)","muli-at",""],["حَرَسًۭا","guards","ḥarasan",""],["شَدِيدًۭا","severe","shadīdan",""],["وَشُهُبًۭا","and flaming fires","washuhuban","",[["وَ",1],["شُهُبًۭا",3725]]]]},{"t":"And we used to sit therein in positions for hearing, but whoever listens now will find a burning flame lying in wait for him.","w":[["وَأَنَّا","And that we","wa-annā","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["ا",11]]],["كُنَّا","used to","kunnā","",[["كُ",21],["نَّا",11]]],["نَقْعُدُ","sit","naqʿudu",""],["مِنْهَا","there in","min'hā","",[["مِنْ",6],["هَا",22]]],["مَقَـٰعِدَ","positions","maqāʿida",""],["لِلسَّمْعِ","for hearing","lilssamʿi","ۖ",[["لِ",8],["ل",2],["سَّمْعِ",475]]],["فَمَن","but (he) who","faman","",[["فَ",7],["مَن",25]]],["يَسْتَمِعِ","listens","yastamiʿi",""],["ٱلْـَٔانَ","now","l-āna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["ـَٔانَ",867]]],["يَجِدْ","will find","yajid",""],["لَهُۥ","for him","lahu","",[["لَ",8],["هُۥ",5]]],["شِهَابًۭا","a flaming fire","shihāban",""],["رَّصَدًۭا","waiting","raṣadan",""]]},{"t":"And we do not know [therefore] whether evil is intended for those on earth or whether their Lord intends for them a right course.","w":[["وَأَنَّا","And that we ","wa-annā","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["ا",11]]],["لَا","not","lā",""],["نَدْرِىٓ","we know","nadrī",""],["أَشَرٌّ","whether evil","asharrun","",[["أَ",31],["شَرٌّ",376]]],["أُرِيدَ","is intended","urīda",""],["بِمَن","for (those) who","biman","",[["بِ",10],["مَن",25]]],["فِى","(are) in","fī",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth","l-arḍi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["أَمْ","or","am",""],["أَرَادَ","intends","arāda",""],["بِهِمْ","for them","bihim","",[["بِ",10],["هِمْ",3]]],["رَبُّهُمْ","their Lord","rabbuhum","",[["رَبُّ",24],["هُمْ",3]]],["رَشَدًۭا","a right path","rashadan",""]]},{"t":"And among us are the righteous, and among us are [others] not so; we were [of] divided ways.","w":[["وَأَنَّا","And that [we]","wa-annā","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["ا",11]]],["مِنَّا","among us","minnā","",[["مِنَّ",6],["ا",11]]],["ٱلصَّـٰلِحُونَ","(are) the righteous","l-ṣāliḥūna","",[["ٱل",2],["صَّـٰلِحُونَ",102]]],["وَمِنَّا","and among us","waminnā","",[["وَ",1],["مِنَّ",6],["ا",11]]],["دُونَ","(are) other than","dūna",""],["ذَٰلِكَ","that","dhālika","ۖ",[["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["كُنَّا","We","kunnā","",[["كُ",21],["نَّا",11]]],["طَرَآئِقَ","(are on) ways","ṭarāiqa",""],["قِدَدًۭا","different","qidadan",""]]},{"t":"And we have become certain that we will never cause failure to Allāh upon earth, nor can we escape Him by flight.","w":[["وَأَنَّا","And that we","wa-annā","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["ا",11]]],["ظَنَنَّآ","[we] have become certain","ẓanannā","",[["ظَنَ",261],["نَّآ",11]]],["أَن","that","an",""],["لَّن","never","lan",""],["نُّعْجِزَ","we will cause failure","nuʿ'jiza",""],["ٱللَّهَ","(to) Allah","l-laha",""],["فِى","in","fī",""],["ٱلْأَرْضِ","the earth","l-arḍi","",[["ٱلْ",2],["أَرْضِ",35]]],["وَلَن","and never","walan","",[["وَ",1],["لَن",126]]],["نُّعْجِزَهُۥ","we can escape Him","nuʿ'jizahu","",[["نُّعْجِزَ",1688],["هُۥ",5]]],["هَرَبًۭا","(by) flight","haraban",""]]},{"t":"And when we heard the guidance [i.e., the Qur’ān], we believed in it. And whoever believes in his Lord will not fear deprivation or burden.","w":[["وَأَنَّا","And that [we]","wa-annā","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["ا",11]]],["لَمَّا","when","lammā",""],["سَمِعْنَا","we heard","samiʿ'nā","",[["سَمِعْ",160],["نَا",11]]],["ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","the Guidance","l-hudā","",[["ٱلْ",2],["هُدَىٰٓ",147]]],["ءَامَنَّا","we believed","āmannā","",[["ءَامَ",30],["نَّا",11]]],["بِهِۦ","in it","bihi","ۖ",[["بِ",10],["هِۦ",5]]],["فَمَن","And whoever","faman","",[["فَ",7],["مَن",25]]],["يُؤْمِنۢ","believes","yu'min",""],["بِرَبِّهِۦ","in his Lord","birabbihi","",[["بِ",10],["رَبِّ",24],["هِۦ",5]]],["فَلَا","then not","falā","",[["فَ",7],["لَا",13]]],["يَخَافُ","he will fear","yakhāfu",""],["بَخْسًۭا","any loss","bakhsan",""],["وَلَا","and not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["رَهَقًۭا","any burden","rahaqan",""]]},{"t":"And among us are Muslims [in submission to Allāh], and among us are the unjust. And whoever has become Muslim - those have sought out the right course.","w":[["وَأَنَّا","And that we","wa-annā","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["ا",11]]],["مِنَّا","among us","minnā","",[["مِنَّ",6],["ا",11]]],["ٱلْمُسْلِمُونَ","(are) Muslims","l-mus'limūna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مُسْلِمُونَ",317]]],["وَمِنَّا","and among us","waminnā","",[["وَ",1],["مِنَّ",6],["ا",11]]],["ٱلْقَـٰسِطُونَ","(are) unjust","l-qāsiṭūna","ۖ",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَـٰسِطُونَ",2557]]],["فَمَنْ","And whoever","faman","",[["فَ",7],["مَنْ",25]]],["أَسْلَمَ","submits","aslama",""],["فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","then those","fa-ulāika","",[["فَ",7],["أُو۟لَـٰٓئِ",72],["كَ",0]]],["تَحَرَّوْا۟","have sought","taḥarraw","",[["تَحَرَّ",3137],["وْا۟",3]]],["رَشَدًۭا","(the) right path","rashadan",""]]},{"t":"But as for the unjust, they will be, for Hell, firewood.'","w":[["وَأَمَّا","And as for","wa-ammā","",[["وَ",1],["أَمَّا",224]]],["ٱلْقَـٰسِطُونَ","the unjust","l-qāsiṭūna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["قَـٰسِطُونَ",2557]]],["فَكَانُوا۟","they will be","fakānū","",[["فَ",7],["كَانُ",21],["وا۟",3]]],["لِجَهَنَّمَ","for Hell","lijahannama","",[["لِ",8],["جَهَنَّمَ",162]]],["حَطَبًۭا","firewood","ḥaṭaban",""]]},{"t":"And [Allāh revealed] that if they had remained straight on the way, We would have given them abundant rain [i.e., provision].","w":[["وَأَلَّوِ","And that if","wa-allawi","",[["وَ",1],["أَ",29],["لَّوِ",73]]],["ٱسْتَقَـٰمُوا۟","they had remained","is'taqāmū","",[["ٱسْتَقَـٰمُ",811],["وا۟",3]]],["عَلَى","on","ʿalā",""],["ٱلطَّرِيقَةِ","the Way","l-ṭarīqati","",[["ٱل",2],["طَّرِيقَةِ",1358]]],["لَأَسْقَيْنَـٰهُم","surely We (would) have given them to drink","la-asqaynāhum","",[["لَ",23],["أَسْقَيْ",944],["نَ",11],["ـٰهُم",3]]],["مَّآءً","water","māan",""],["غَدَقًۭا","(in) abundance","ghadaqan",""]]},{"t":"So We might test them therein. And whoever turns away from the remembrance of his Lord He will put into arduous punishment.","w":[["لِّنَفْتِنَهُمْ","That We might test them","linaftinahum","",[["لِّ",8],["نَفْتِنَ",458],["هُمْ",3]]],["فِيهِ","therein","fīhi","ۚ",[["فِي",14],["هِ",5]]],["وَمَن","And whoever","waman","",[["وَ",1],["مَن",25]]],["يُعْرِضْ","turns away","yuʿ'riḍ",""],["عَن","from","ʿan",""],["ذِكْرِ","the Remembrance","dhik'ri",""],["رَبِّهِۦ","(of) his Lord","rabbihi","",[["رَبِّ",24],["هِۦ",5]]],["يَسْلُكْهُ","He will make him enter","yasluk'hu","",[["يَسْلُكْ",727],["هُ",5]]],["عَذَابًۭا","a punishment","ʿadhāban",""],["صَعَدًۭا","severe","ṣaʿadan",""]]},{"t":"And [He revealed] that the masjids are for Allāh, so do not invoke with Allāh anyone.","w":[["وَأَنَّ","And that","wa-anna","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41]]],["ٱلْمَسَـٰجِدَ","the masjids","l-masājida","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَسَـٰجِدَ",399]]],["لِلَّهِ","(are) for Allah","lillahi","",[["لِ",8],["لَّهِ",9]]],["فَلَا","so (do) not","falā","",[["فَ",7],["لَا",13]]],["تَدْعُوا۟","call","tadʿū","",[["تَدْعُ",81],["وا۟",4]]],["مَعَ","with","maʿa",""],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah","l-lahi",""],["أَحَدًۭا","anyone","aḥadan",""]]},{"t":"And that when the Servant [i.e., Prophet] of Allāh stood up supplicating Him, they almost became about him a compacted mass.\"","w":[["وَأَنَّهُۥ","And that","wa-annahu","",[["وَ",1],["أَنَّ",41],["هُۥ",5]]],["لَمَّا","when","lammā",""],["قَامَ","stood up","qāma",""],["عَبْدُ","(the) slave","ʿabdu",""],["ٱللَّ